{"4526750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Night Creed", "steam_appid": 4526750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ruined lands of an ancient kingdom, an evil that has lurked for centuries in the ruins of ancient castles awakens. Monsters emerge from dark rifts, filling the deserted fortresses and forgotten roads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nameless warrior in the dark hood does not come to these lands by chance. He is a hunter of darkness, the last of an ancient order that once protected people from such nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Creed is a 2D platformer. You control a character and move horizontally, fending off waves of enemies from both sides, both ground-based and flying. The player can use rolls to dodge attacks, use magic to destroy large groups of enemies, and collect life and mana orbs, which are needed to use magic. At the end of each wave, a boss appears—a unique enemy with a large amount of health and a unique attack pattern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Musical style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Responsive controls</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ruined lands of an ancient kingdom, an evil that has lurked for centuries in the ruins of ancient castles awakens. Monsters emerge from dark rifts, filling the deserted fortresses and forgotten roads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nameless warrior in the dark hood does not come to these lands by chance. He is a hunter of darkness, the last of an ancient order that once protected people from such nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Creed is a 2D platformer. You control a character and move horizontally, fending off waves of enemies f